    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d700">

                <pb facs="0824" n="1658" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1658"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 652.119/410</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Willard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-11T18:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 11, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received January 12, 2.10
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>987. Department’s 818, January 8, 7 p.m. Embassy firmly of opinion, in which
                    Major Belmont concurs, that for any licenses for <pb facs="0825" n="1659"
                        xml:id="pg1659"/> embargoed articles to be issued by War Trade Board would
                    be fatal to pending negotiations. That Spain has been able until the last few
                    days to secure export permits for all she desired from the United States
                    notwithstanding embargo, has created feeling here that our embargo was not real.
                    Spain is just beginning to appreciate her position and the need of coming to
                    terms with us.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Willard</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
